t":"| Option        | Type                          | Default   | Description                                       |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `datasources` | `Array<DatasourceDefinition>` | A dataset | Where property values come from. See Datasources. |","table":"table-0"},"1381":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-25","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#define-an-object-type","content":"| Option         | Type      | Default | Description                                  |\n| -------------- | --------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `editsEnabled` | `boolean` |         | Whether users can edit objects of this type. |","table":"table-0"},"1382":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-26","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#define-an-object-type","content":"| Option               | Type                                                         | Default | Description                         |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `editsHistoryConfig` | `{ enabled: boolean; storeAllPreviousProperties?: boolean }` |         | Whether to keep a history of edits. |","table":"table-0"},"1383":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-27","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#define-an-object-type","content":"| Option    | Type            | Default | Description                                |\n| --------- | --------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `aliases` | `Array<string>` |         | Other names to find the type by in search. |","table":"table-0"},"1384":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-28","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#define-an-object-type","content":"| Option                          | Type      | Default | Description                                                                                                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------- | --------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `includeEmptyBackingDatasource` | `boolean` |         | Ask `@osdk/maker-experimental` to package an empty backing dataset. Only valid when every datasource is `dataset` or `derived`. The `maker` CLI ignores it. |","table":"table-0"},"1385":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-29","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#define-an-object-type","content":"| Option       | Type                                                                                    | Default | Description                        |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `permission` | `\"roles\" \\| \"publicProject\" \\| { type: \"ontologyPackage\"; ontologyPackageRid: string }` |         | The permission model for the type. |","table":"table-0"},"1386":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-30","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#primary-key-and-title","content":"The primary key and title must both name properties of the object type, and `defineObject` throws if either is missing."},"1387":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-31","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#primary-key-and-title","content":"**Primary key.** Must be a primitive type, such as `string` or `integer`, and cannot be `editOnly`. Every object needs a unique value."},"1388":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-32","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#primary-key-and-title","content":"**Title.** Must be a primitive type, or a struct whose `mainValue` is primitive."},"1389":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-33","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"Each entry in `properties` maps an API name to a property definition. Only `type` is required. Property API names start with a letter and contain letters, digits, and `_`."},"1390":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-34","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option | Type               | Default | Description                   |\n| ------ | ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `type` | `PropertyTypeType` |         | Required. See Property types. |","table":"table-1"},"1391":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-35","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option        | Type     | Default                                        | Description                |\n| ------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `displayName` | `string` | The API name with its first letter capitalized | The name shown in Foundry. |","table":"table-1"},"1392":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-36","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option        | Type     | Default | Description                     |\n| ------------- | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `description` | `string` |         | A description shown in Foundry. |","table":"table-1"},"1393":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-37","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option  | Type      | Default | Description                       |\n| ------- | --------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `array` | `boolean` | `false` | Store a list of values of `type`. |","table":"table-1"},"1394":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-38","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option     | Type                                                                      | Default | Description                                                  |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `reducers` | `Array<{ direction: \"ascending\" \\| \"descending\"; structField?: string }>` |         | For arrays, how to reduce the list to one value for display. |","table":"table-1"},"1395":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-39","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option      | Type                         | Default | Description                                                                                  |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `valueType` | `ValueTypeDefinitionVersion` |         | A value type from `defineValueType`. Its constraints apply to the property. See Value types. |","table":"table-1"},"1396":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-40","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option               | Type                 | Default | Description                                                                                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sharedPropertyType` | `SharedPropertyType` |         | Back the property with a shared property type. A shared property type can back only one property per object type. See Shared property types. |","table":"table-1"},"1397":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-41","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option        | Type                                                | Default | Description                                                                                         |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `nullability` | `{ noNulls: boolean; noEmptyCollections: boolean }` |         | Disallow nulls or empty lists. Generated actions make the parameter required when `noNulls` is set. |","table":"table-1"},"1398":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-42","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option       | Type                                  | Default    | Description                                 |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `visibility` | `\"PROMINENT\" \\| \"NORMAL\" \\| \"HIDDEN\"` | `\"NORMAL\"` | How prominently Foundry shows the property. |","table":"table-1"},"1399":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-43","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option   | Type               | Default | Description                                                                        |\n| -------- | ------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `status` | `ObjectTypeStatus` |         | The property's status. Must match the object's status unless the object is active. |","table":"table-1"},"1400":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-44","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option     | Type      | Default | Description                                                                   |\n| ---------- | --------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `editOnly` | `boolean` |         | The property has no datasource column and only holds values written by edits. |","table":"table-1"},"1401":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-45","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option             | Type      | Default                     | Description                         |\n| ------------------ | --------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `indexedForSearch` | `boolean` | `true`, except `attachment` | Whether the property is searchable. |","table":"table-1"},"1402":{"id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types-46","page_id":"/ontology-as-code/object-types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ontology-as-code/object-types#properties","content":"| Option        | Type                                    | Default                                  | Description                                                                                                              