el","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/foundry-model#see-also","content":"Chat and text generation"},"3407":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","type":"page","content":"generateText","breadcrumbs":["OSDK TypeScript","Reference","@osdk/aip-core"],"tags":[],"url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text"},"3408":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-0","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","content":"Generate a complete text response from a Foundry language model in one request."},"3409":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-1","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#options","content":"Options"},"3410":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-2","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#returns","content":"Returns"},"3411":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-3","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#example","content":"Example"},"3412":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-4","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#see-also","content":"See also"},"3413":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-5","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","content":"Sends one request to the Foundry Language Model Service and resolves when the model finishes. The call is single-step: when the model requests a tool, the result lists the call in `toolCalls`, and your code runs the tool and sends a follow-up request."},"3414":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-6","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions-model","content":"| `model` | `LanguageModel` | The language model to use. Build one via `foundryModel(...)`. |\n| ------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |","table":"type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions"},"3415":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-7","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions-prompt","content":"| `prompt?` | `string \\| ModelMessage[]` | Plain text prompt. Mutually exclusive with `messages`. |\n| --------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |","table":"type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions"},"3416":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-8","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions-messages","content":"| `messages?` | `ModelMessage[]` | Conversation history. Mutually exclusive with `prompt`. |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |","table":"type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions"},"3417":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-9","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions-system","content":"| `system?` | `string \\| SystemModelMessage[] \\| SystemModelMessage` | System instructions, prepended to the conversation. |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |","table":"type-table-generateText.ts-GenerateTextOptions"},"3418":{"id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text-10","page_id":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/aip-core/generate-text#type-table-generateText.