-------------------------------------------------- |\n| `errorInstanceId` | `string \\| undefined` | An ID for this occurrence. Include it when you report an issue to Palantir support. |","table":"table-0"},"3582":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-13","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#palantirapierror","content":"| Field        | Type  | Description                                                         |\n| ------------ | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `parameters` | `any` | Error-specific details, such as the primary key that was not found. |","table":"table-0"},"3583":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-14","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#actionvalidationerror","content":"| Field     | Type     | Description                                                         |\n| --------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message` | `string` | `\"Validation Error: \"` followed by the validation response as JSON. |","table":"table-1"},"3584":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-15","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#actionvalidationerror","content":"| Field               | Type                   | Description         |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `validation.result` | `\"VALID\" \\| \"INVALID\"` | The overall result. |","table":"table-1"},"3585":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-16","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#actionvalidationerror","content":"| Field                           | Type                             | Description                                      |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `validation.submissionCriteria` | `SubmissionCriteriaEvaluation[]` | Each submission criterion and whether it passed. |","table":"table-1"},"3586":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-17","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#actionvalidationerror","content":"| Field                   | Type                                        | Description                                        |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `validation.parameters` | `Record<string, ParameterEvaluationResult>` | The evaluation of each parameter, by parameter ID. |","table":"table-1"},"3587":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-18","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#see-also","content":"Errors"},"3588":{"id":"/reference/client/errors-19","page_id":"/reference/client/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/errors#see-also","content":"useOsdkAction"},"3589":{"id":"/reference/client/object-set","page_id":"/reference/client/object-set","type":"page","content":"ObjectSet","breadcrumbs":["OSDK TypeScript","Reference","@osdk/client"],"tags":[],"url":"/reference/client/object-set"},"3590":{"id":"/reference/client/object-set-0","page_id":"/reference/client/object-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/client/object-set","content":"Methods of an OSDK ObjectSet for filtering, set operations, pivots, aggregation, paging, and subscriptions."},"3591":{"id":"/reference/client/object-set-1","page_id":"/reference/client/object-set","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/client/object-set#methods","content":"Methods"},"3592":{"id":"/reference/client/object-set-2","page_id":"/reference/client/object-set","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/reference/client/object-set#build-a-set","content":"Build a set"},"3593":{"id":"/reference/client/object-set-3","page_id":"/reference/client/object-set","type":"