:"/reference/react/osdk-provider-9","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#props","content":"| Prop             | Type      | Default                             | Description                                                             |\n| ---------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `enableDevTools` | `boolean` | `true` when devtools are registered | Turns the devtools integration on or off. Ignored in production builds. |","table":"table-0"},"3814":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-10","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#props","content":"| Prop      | Type                                 | Default | Description                                                                                             |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `devMode` | `ObservableClientOptions[\"devMode\"]` |         | Development-only behavior of the observable client. Ignored in production builds. See the fields below. |","table":"table-0"},"3815":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-11","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#devmode-fields","content":"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `actionDelayMs` | `number` | Delay, in milliseconds, applied to the result of an action that has an optimistic update, so the optimistic state stays visible. Defaults to `1000`; pass `0` to disable it. |","table":"table-1"},"3816":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-12","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#devmode-fields","content":"| Field      | Type                                                           | Description                                                                                   |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `logLevel` | `\"trace\" \\| \"debug\" \\| \"info\" \\| \"warn\" \\| \"error\" \\| \"fatal\"` | Log level of the observable client. Defaults to `\"error\"`; pass `\"debug\"` to see its tracing. |","table":"table-1"},"3817":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-13","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#devmode-fields","content":"| Field             | Type      | Description                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `debug.refCounts` | `boolean` | Logs the reference-count lifecycle of cache entries and shortens their retention window. |","table":"table-1"},"3818":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-14","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-provider#devmode-fields","content":"| Field             | Type      | Description             |\n| ----------------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| `debug.cacheKeys` | `boolean` | Logs cache-key lookups. |","table":"table-1"},"3819":{"id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider-15","page_id":"/reference/react/osdk-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/osdk-pr