","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/use-object-set#type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions-pageSize","content":"| `pageSize?` | `number` | The preferred page size for the list |\n| ----------- | -------- | ------------------------------------ |","table":"type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions"},"3949":{"id":"/reference/react/use-object-set-13","page_id":"/reference/react/use-object-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/use-object-set#type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions-orderBy","content":"| `orderBy?` | `{ [K in PropertyKeys<Q>]?: \"asc\" \\| \"desc\" \\| undefined; }` | Sort order for the results |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |","table":"type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions"},"3950":{"id":"/reference/react/use-object-set-14","page_id":"/reference/react/use-object-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/use-object-set#type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions-dedupeIntervalMs","content":"| `dedupeIntervalMs?` | `number` | Minimum time between fetch requests in milliseconds (defaults to 2000ms) |\n| ------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |","table":"type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions"},"3951":{"id":"/reference/react/use-object-set-15","page_id":"/reference/react/use-object-set","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/reference/react/use-object-set#type-table-useObjectSet.tsx-UseObjectSetOptions-autoFetchMore","content":"| `autoFetchMore?` | `number \\| boolean` | Automatically fetch additional pages on initial load. - `true`: Fetch all available pages automatically - `number`: Fetch pages until at least this many items are loaded - `undefined` (default): Only fetch the first page, user must call fetchMore() |\n| ---------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------