254":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-23","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"A numeric definition, from `selectProperty` on a numeric property or a numeric aggregation, has expression methods. Each binary method takes a number or another numeric definition:"},"4255":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-24","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"| Method                                              | Result      |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `add(x)`, `subtract(x)`, `multiply(x)`, `divide(x)` | Arithmetic. |","table":"table-2"},"4256":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-25","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"| Method             | Result                       |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `min(x)`, `max(x)` | The smaller or larger value. |","table":"table-2"},"4257":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-26","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"| Method              | Result                                     |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `abs()`, `negate()` | The absolute value, or the value times -1. |","table":"table-2"},"4258":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-27","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"A date or timestamp definition has:"},"4259":{"id":"/sdk/derived-properties-28","page_id":"/sdk/derived-properties","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/derived-properties#expressions","content":"| Method                     | Result                                                     |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `min(o