e":"text","url":"/sdk/errors","content":"The errors @osdk/client throws, the fields of PalantirApiError and ActionValidationError, Result-returning methods, retries, and patterns for handling them."},"4272":{"id":"/sdk/errors-1","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#error-types","content":"Error types"},"4273":{"id":"/sdk/errors-2","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#palantirapierror","content":"`PalantirApiError`"},"4274":{"id":"/sdk/errors-3","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#actionvalidationerror","content":"`ActionValidationError`"},"4275":{"id":"/sdk/errors-4","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#methods-that-return-a-result","content":"Methods that return a result"},"4276":{"id":"/sdk/errors-5","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#retries","content":"Retries"},"4277":{"id":"/sdk/errors-6","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#errors-before-a-request","content":"Errors before a request"},"4278":{"id":"/sdk/errors-7","page_id":"/sdk/errors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/sdk/errors#patterns","content":"Patterns"},"4279":{"id":"/sdk/errors-8","page_id":"/sdk/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/errors","content":"Every `@osdk/client` method that sends a request rejects on failure. This page lists what it rejects with, which fields to branch on, and the methods that return a result instead of throwing."},"4280":{"id":"/sdk/errors-9","page_id":"/sdk/errors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/sdk/errors#error-types","content":"| Error              | Import         | Thrown when                                                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `PalantirApiError` | `@osdk/client` | Foundry returned an error response. Also the base class for the nex