r-42","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker","content":"The picker lets users select markings grouped by category. Some categories are **disjunctive** (pick exactly one, like a sensitivity level) and others are **conjunctive** (pick any combination, like access groups). The server enforces which combinations are valid, which markings are implied by others, and which are disallowed."},"5973":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-43","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Before using CBAC components, make sure you have completed the library setup described in Prerequisites, including:"},"5974":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-44","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Installing the required dependencies"},"5975":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-45","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Wrapping your app with `OsdkProvider`"},"5976":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-46","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#prerequisites","content":"Adding the CSS imports"},"5977":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-47","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#inline-picker","content":"The simplest way to use the CBAC picker is inline with `CbacPicker`:"},"5978":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-48","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#inline-picker","content":"This renders a marking picker that fetches CBAC categories and markings via the OSDK, displays them grouped by category, and shows a classification banner. The server enforces marking restrictions automatically — the picker reflects which markings are implied, disallowed, or required based on the current selection."},"5979":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-49","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#picker-in-a-dialog","content":"For modal workflows, use `CbacPickerDialog`:"},"5980":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-50","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpicker-1","content":"| Name                | Type       | Description                                            |\n| ------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `initialMarkingIds` | `string[]` | Initial set of selected marking IDs. Defaults to `[]`. |","table":"table-0"},"5981":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-51","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpicker-1","content":"| Name       | Type                             | Description                                      |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `onChange` | `(markingIds: string[]) => void` | **Required.** Called when the selection changes. |","table":"table-0"},"5982":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-52","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#cbacpicker-1","content":"| Name                          | Type                          | Description                                                                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `maxClassificationConstraint` | `MaxClassificationConstraint` | Optional constraint capping the maximum classification a user may select. When set, the picker surfaces a callout if the selection exceeds it. |","table":"table-0"},"5983":{"id":"/components