/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#togglemarking","content":"**Conjunctive** categories: adds or removes the marking (checkbox behavior)"},"6039":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-109","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#togglemarking","content":"**Disjunctive** categories: replaces the existing selection in that category (radio behavior)"},"6040":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-110","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#computemarkingstates","content":"Computes the display state for each marking based on the current selection, implied markings, and disallowed markings."},"6041":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-111","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#groupmarkingsbycategory","content":"Groups a flat list of markings into `CategoryMarkingGroup` arrays, ordered by category."},"6042":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-112","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#groupmarkingsbycategory","content":"Categories are ordered by descending `priority`. Within a category, `COMMON` markings come first, then `UNCOMMON`, then markings without a `prominence`, each group by descending `priority`. `CbacBannerPopover` uses the same order."},"6043":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-113","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#example-4-custom-data-fetching-with-basecbacpicker","content":"Use `BaseCbacPicker` when you want to supply your own marking data instead of fetching from the OSDK:"},"6044":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-114","page_id":"/components/cbac-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/components/cbac-picker#what-the-server-controls","content":"The following data is **computed server-side** and cannot be changed by the frontend:"},"6045":{"id":"/components/cbac-picker-115","page_id":"/compo